---
import { Landmark, Compass, Network } from 'lucide-astro';
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="How We Work, By Who You Are — AI Resource Exploration"
  description="Three buyer tracks — government, commercial explorer, strategic partner — one exploration stack. Find the path built for your mandate."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-geo-slate text-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-5">Built for the buyer behind the contract</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl text-white leading-[1.08] mb-6">
        How we work, by who you are.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto">
        CAGE-IN and the tools around it were built in the field, on real exploration programs. The science is the same regardless of who commissions the work — but the procurement path, the delivery structure, and the risk allocation look different depending on whether you sit in a government office, a listed explorer, or a corporate strategy team. Find your track below.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Audience-track card grid -->
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-geo-deep">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6" data-reveal>

        <!-- Government card -->
        <a
          href="/for/government"
          class="group flex flex-col bg-geo-slate rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-geo-gold/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300 p-8 md:p-10"
        >
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-geo-primary/30 transition-colors">
            <Landmark size={24} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">For Indian Government &amp; PSUs</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-white font-semibold mb-4 leading-snug">
            Exploration cadence the NCMM mandate demands — without building a data-science division.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            AI-augmented prospectivity mapping that fits your procurement frame, your data-sovereignty requirements, and your capacity-building mandate. India-resident IP. Results-as-a-Service commercial model.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">See how we work with you →</p>
        </a>

        <!-- Commercial Explorer card -->
        <a
          href="/for/explorer"
          class="group flex flex-col bg-geo-slate rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-geo-gold/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300 p-8 md:p-10"
        >
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-geo-primary/30 transition-colors">
            <Compass size={24} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">For Commercial Explorers</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-white font-semibold mb-4 leading-snug">
            Targets your board can defend and your QP can sign off on.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            Thirty years of field experience encoded into a ranked target portfolio — delivered in weeks, referenced to peer-reviewed deposit models, and structured for NI 43-101 and JORC-aligned reporting.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">See how we work with you →</p>
        </a>

        <!-- Strategic Partner card -->
        <a
          href="/for/partner"
          class="group flex flex-col bg-geo-slate rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-geo-gold/60 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-black/30 transition-all duration-300 p-8 md:p-10"
        >
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-lg bg-geo-primary/20 text-geo-secondary flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:bg-geo-primary/30 transition-colors">
            <Network size={24} />
          </div>
          <p class="text-geo-gold text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3">For Strategic Partners</p>
          <h3 class="font-display text-xl md:text-2xl text-white font-semibold mb-4 leading-snug">
            Co-invest in the next generation of the exploration stack.
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed flex-1">
            The IP portfolio, the roadmap, and the technical depth of an established exploration-software house — available for white-label, embedded-licence, and co-development arrangements at institutional scale.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-6 text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">See how we work with you →</p>
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fluid-software anchor panel (CTA-banner pattern with diagonal overlay) -->
  <section class="py-14 md:py-24 bg-geo-slate text-white relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/5">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03]" style="background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, #fff 0, #fff 1px, transparent 0, transparent 50%); background-size: 30px 30px;"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center" data-reveal>
      <p class="text-geo-gold text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Why our tools fit your file</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-6 leading-tight">AI-backed fluid software</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-prose mx-auto mb-8">
        Our tools are not static models frozen at training time. Their geological reasoning evolves as the field evolves — new peer-reviewed publications refine deposit models, new interpretation methods sharpen existing analyses, and new mineral discoveries open new deposit categories. The software updates with the science. What you commission today stays current.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/technologies/cage-in#living-methodology"
        class="inline-block px-8 py-3.5 rounded bg-geo-gold text-white font-semibold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider hover:bg-amber-500 transition-colors"
      >
        How CAGE-IN evolves →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
